body:
Here's how I was able to whip this together pretty quickly, grabbing a comma script from SO. (I'm using `addCommas` elsewhere.)

**HTML**

```
${{#helpers.addCommas}}{{price}}{{/helpers.addCommas}}
```

**JavaScript**

```
search.templatesConfig.helpers.addCommas = function(/*text, render*/) {
   return this.price.toString().addCommas();
};

String.prototype.addCommas = function() {
  nStr = this;
  nStr += '';
  x = nStr.split('.');
  x1 = x[0];
  x2 = x.length > 1 ? '.' + x[1] : '';
  var rgx = /(\d+)(\d{3})/;
  while (rgx.test(x1)) {
          x1 = x1.replace(rgx, '$1' + ',' + '$2');
  }
  return x1 + x2;
}
```
